|               |                             FilterExec: o_orderdate@2 >= 1994-01-01 AND o_orderdate@2 < 1995-01-01, projection=[o_orderkey@0, o_custkey@1]                                                                                       |
|               |                               SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |                                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                                   DataSourceExec: partitions=16, partition_sizes=[<redacted>]                                                                                                                                    |
